RemotingCommand response/oneway flag helper oracle coverage (2026-10-17)

- Extended the pinned Java runtime fixture to invoke `markResponseType`,
  `isResponseType`, `markOnewayRPC`, and `isOnewayRPC` for default, oneway,
  combined, repeated-mark, and unrelated-high-bit cases. The generated values
  are flags 0, 2, 3, 3, and 259 with matching type and predicates.
- The fixture comparison confirmed the only change was the nested
  `remotingEnumMethodCases.commandFlags` entry. Rust assertions compare the
  Java flag, type, and both predicates and require the fixture case count to
  match. Code/test commit: `f017a1df`.
- Passed `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-remoting --all-features --locked`
  (108 unit tests, 8 codec tests, 1 fuzz regression, 7 security tests, 107
  transport tests, and 15 doctests); strict all-target/all-feature Remoting
  Clippy; focused `remoting_enum_methods_and_command_type_match_invoked_java`;
  `cargo fmt --all -- --check`; and `git diff --check`.
- `mvn -o -f compat/java-reference/pom.xml verify` passed all 37 scenarios,
  fixture drift checks, and Java/Rust cross-decodes. The API crosswalk and
  release-checklist update are committed separately. Broad P18-V01 remains
  open.

RemotingCommand suspended-state API parity (2026-10-17)

- Pinned Java 5.5.1 declares public `isSuspended()` / `setSuspended(boolean)`
  over a false-default, non-wire field. Rust now exposes `suspended` with
  `is_suspended` / `set_suspended`; a Java-invoked fixture covers default,
  true, and reset-to-false, and a Rust assertion confirms command-header
  encoding omits the state and decode resets it to false.
- Source review of pinned `NettyRemotingAbstract.writeResponse` shows Java uses
  this state as `LABEL_IS_LONG_POLLING` on RPC latency metrics. The Rust
  remoting crate has no equivalent RPC metric emission; this observable
  telemetry flow remains open and is not waived by the API field mapping.
- Passed `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-remoting --all-features --locked`
  (108 unit tests, 8 codec tests, 1 fuzz regression, 7 security tests, 107
  transport tests, and 15 doctests), strict all-target/all-feature Remoting
  Clippy, format/diff checks, and `mvn -o -f compat/java-reference/pom.xml
  verify` (37 scenarios, fixture drift and cross-decodes). Code commit:
  `811d6dda`; documentation and this log entry are recorded separately.
